==Strategy==
These first six stages are very simple in nature. The stage gives you ample time to build up money, and the supporting enemy waves can be cleared out very quickly. The hardest part of this stage is chipping down Sachiel once everyone else is dead, which can take a while given Sachiel's rapid attacks and high stats. Try luring Sachiel a bit to the base to create an easier cleanup. The Thunderbolt Cannon is recommended here to allow Bahamut to get longer chains against Sachiel.

If you have any EVA Angel Killer units, feel free to use them to make the process of chipping down each boss quicker.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]: Bahamut's extremely high damage makes him very good here to kill the Gories or Hippoes here. If Talented, Bahamut's effective damage doubles, allowing you to kill Sachiel even faster.
*[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]]: Slime is an extremely strong unit here, being able to abuse the peons to unleash high damage Wave attacks. If you have Slime's True Form, he becomes able to spread his Wave even further. Slime's True Form giving him both higher speed and range allows him to connect onto Sachiel.
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]: Courier is a fast generalist attacker similar to Seafarer who can kill the peons and chip Sachiel down.
*[[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]: A strong unit for the supporting enemies here. Also can chip down Sachiel given proper timing.
*[[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]]: Similar to Bullet Train Cat, being a faster attacker with good chip potential.
*[[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]]: Seafarer's stats allows him to work as a generalist attacker as well as a unit to clean up Sachiel.
*[[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cutter Cat]]: Cutter has much lower damage than Bullet Train Cat, but has a Survive to allow him to get much higher damage in. Also has an Attack combo with Li'l Brave Cat.
*[[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]]: Extremely useful unit to chip down Sachiel.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*Smaller Ubers with lower cost and cooldown can do well for the supporting peons. Examples include [[Child of Destiny Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|Child of Destiny Phono]], [[Celestial Child Luna (Uber Rare Cat)|Celestial Child Luna]] and [[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]].
*Any Uber with over 500 range is very strong here to make chipping Sachiel down take less than an eternity.

