==Strategy==
Ramiel's stages are pretty similar to Sachiel's, both being a slow boss with peons that die off after a while and very high range. In Ramiel's case, however, her Omni Strike effectively doubles her range, and her attacks can inflict at least 450,000 damage, which is more than enough to instantly eliminate anything that lacks the Survive ability or Metal trait, so make sure she doesn't push much. Your main goal is to kill Cyberhorn as fast as possible so you can start chipping Ramiel down.

If you have any EVA Angel Killer units, feel free to use them to make the process of chipping down each boss quicker.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]: Bahamut's extremely high damage makes him very good here to kill Cyberhorn. If Talented, Bahamut's effective damage doubles, allowing you to kill Ramiel even faster.
*[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]]: Slime is an extremely strong unit here, being able to abuse the peons to unleash high damage Wave attacks. If you have Slime's True Form, he becomes able to spread his Wave even further. Slime's True Form giving him both higher speed and range allows him to connect onto Ramiel better.
*[[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]]: Guard's ridiculously high DPS against Cyberhorn means that you can quickly start chipping Ramiel down much faster.
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]: Courier is a fast generalist attacker similar to Seafarer who can kill the peons and chip Ramiel down.
*[[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]: A strong unit for the supporting enemies here, being able to one-shot Mistress Celeboodle as well as Slow Cyberhorn if Talented.
*[[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]]: Similar to Bullet Train Cat, being a faster attacker with good chip potential.
*[[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]]: Given Seafarer's natural Survive ability, he's your best choice for controlling Cyberhorn here.
*[[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]]: Extremely useful unit to chip down Ramiel.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*Rushers: Examples include [[Blanka (Uber Rare Cat)|Blanka]], [[Issun Boshi (Uber Rare Cat)|Oni Battlepod Kozuchimaru]] and [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Immortal Yukimura]].

